  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 91036662a85844eb162bdfbe2ea8ce9c, type: 3}
  m_Name: ItalianRules
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  displayName: Italian
  description: 8x8 draughts - short-range kings only, men can't capture backward or capture Kings, and only a King can capture a King.
  longDescription: "<b><color=#D4AF37>Goal:</color></b>\nCapture all of your opponent's pieces, or leave them with no legal move to make.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Board:</color></b>\nPlayed on an 8x8 board, with the bottom-right corner square dark for each player. Each player starts with 12 pieces filling the first three rows on their side. White always moves first.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Movement:</color></b>\nMen move diagonally forward only and can never capture backward. Kings move and capture one square at a time, forward or backward - they don't fly.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Capturing:</color></b>\nCapturing is mandatory, with a strict tiebreak whenever more than one path is available: most pieces taken wins first, then a King's capture beats a man's, then whichever takes the most Kings, then whichever captures a King soonest.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Immunity:</color></b>\nA man can never capture a King - only an opposing King may capture a King.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>No-Removal:</color></b>\nA captured piece stays on the board - still blocking its square - until your turn ends; you can't jump the same piece twice.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Kings:</color></b>\nReaching the back row crowns a piece immediately and ends its turn right there.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Win:</color></b>\nCapture every enemy piece, or leave your opponent with no legal move.\n\n<b><color=#D4AF37>Draw:</color></b>\nEither player may offer a draw at any time; if accepted, the match ends level. Italian has no move-limit or repetition draw beyond that."
  rows: 8
  columns: 8
  pieceRowsPerSide: 3
  movementScheme: 0
  piecesOnAllSquares: 0
  leaveBackRowEmpty: 0
  flyingKings: 0
  menCaptureBackward: 0
  menCannotCaptureKings: 1
  mustCaptureMaximum: 1
  preferKingMover: 1
  preferKingCaptures: 1
  preferEarlierKingCapture: 1
  midChainPromotionRule: 1
  deferCaptureRemoval: 1
  forbidImmediateReversal: 0
  noProgressMoveLimit: 40
  singleManLosesToKing: 0
  firstMoveColor: 1
  darkSquareBottomRight: 1
  threefoldRepetitionEnabled: 0
  threeVsOneKingDrawLimit: 0
  twoVsOneKingDrawLimit: 0
  oneVsOneIsDraw: 0
